  "root_cause": "bad_deploy_regression",
  "summary": "A recent deployment introduced a regression in the discount application logic, causing a TypeError when attempting to read 'percentOff' from a null value. This led to a sharp increase in error rates and elevated p95 latency starting at 09:23:00, impacting checkout service reliability.",
