        {
          "source": "metrics/http.csv",
          "line": 61,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:59:00.000Z,47.48,378.06,0.0705,345"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "Downstream dependency failures are unlikely since errors are specific to the checkout service's discount application logic and not generic upstream errors.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 645,
          "quote": "\"msg\":\"TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'percentOff')\",\"handler\":\"applyDiscount\""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "action_items": [
    "Rollback the deployment v2026.3.17-a1 to restore service stability.",
    "Add null checks and validation in the applyDiscount handler to prevent null pointer exceptions.",
    "Improve testing coverage for discount logic, especially for tiered discount scenarios.",
    "Implement monitoring for specific error types to detect similar regressions earlier."
  ]
